# Suppress warnings triggered in dependencies
leak:QGuiApplicationPrivate::createPlatformIntegration

# Some OpenCL drivers allocate during platform discovery and never free it, in
# code mapped from a GPU device node. The module name is matched before any
# symbolization, so llvm-symbolizer is never asked to read the device node: it
# would block on that read, and the process under test would never exit.
leak:/dev/dri/renderD
